WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:01.280
Your general

00:01.360 --> 00:02.760
Accepts the order

00:03.200 --> 00:04.600
General Zhenbei Chen Ying

00:04.920 --> 00:06.280
Your general is here

00:06.360 --> 00:08.040
I order you to lead one army

00:08.120 --> 00:09.520
Follow the Luoshui northward

00:09.640 --> 00:11.040
Enter northern Qing Province

00:11.120 --> 00:12.120
Take Wuyang City

00:12.200 --> 00:12.760
With Yiyang

00:12.920 --> 00:14.400
Facing each other north and south

00:14.480 --> 00:15.560
Remember

00:15.640 --> 00:16.840
Wuyang and Yiyang

00:16.920 --> 00:18.000
Form a line

00:18.080 --> 00:19.560
Supporting each other like horns

00:19.640 --> 00:20.920
With these two cities

00:21.000 --> 00:23.360
Can we ensure our supply lines are clear

00:23.440 --> 00:24.560
If lost

00:24.640 --> 00:25.920
Military law will be applied

00:26.000 --> 00:27.667
Your general accepts the order

00:55.320 --> 00:56.720
Alert

00:59.120 --> 00:59.920
Catch him

01:00.000 --> 01:01.880
Lest the Wutu learn our movements

